---
description: |
  Keeps the latest version of each rule.

  TruePattern never revokes rule versions: an update adds a new version with
  the same `id` and a later `modified` time. The operator buffers its input
  and emits one STIX object per `id`, the one with the latest `modified` time.
  Among versions with the same time, it keeps the first one in input order.
---

sort -time(modified), id
deduplicate id
